  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 303.02 Applicability. These rules shall apply to new groundwater sources of water used in the production of bottled water.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at part heading for Env-Dw 303) #11059, eff 4-1-16",
